{"ts": 0.13907, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[1;97menv 4 — the prompt is a variable\u001b[0m\r\n\r\nThe text before your cursor is the variable \u001b[92mPS1\u001b[0m. Change it and the\r\n", "len": 126}
{"ts": 0.139109, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "prompt changes at once.\r\n\r\n  \u001b[92mPS1='me> '\u001b[0m       \u001b[90m# the prompt is now me>\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[92mPS1='$ '\u001b[0m         \u001b[90m# and now a plain dollar sign\u001b[0m\r\n\r\nTry both. Then type \u001b[92mnext\u001b[0m and look at the prompt on the next screen.\r\n\r\n\u001b[93m▶ Change the prompt, then type \u001b[92mnext\u001b[93m.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n", "len": 300}
