{"ts": 0.189246, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\r\n\u001b[1;97menv — gate\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[36mRecall\u001b[0m (three questions, all three must be correct).\r\nFirst, three questions. Type your answer in words; this is not the shell.\r\n\r\nThen a \u001b[36mpractical task\u001b[0m.\r\n\r\n", "len": 204}
