{"ts": 0.254747, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[1;97menv — task\u001b[0m\r\n\r\nProve that a child program can see a variable you exported. You will\r\n", "len": 97}
{"ts": 0.254781, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "work inside \u001b[94m/var/folders/jx/f_4n055973x5cwnyh_mhlw9h0000gn/T/shelltutor-sim-home-00ntda7j/env\u001b[0m.\r\n\r\n  1. set \u001b[92mTOPIC\u001b[0m to the word \u001b[36mshell\u001b[0m\r\n  2. export it\r\n  3. run a child \u001b[92mbash -c\u001b[0m that prints \u001b[92m$TOPIC\u001b[0m into \u001b[94mseen.txt\u001b[0m\r\n     \u001b[90m(hint: single quotes, so the child replaces the variable)\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[90mI will check: seen.txt holds the word shell, and your history shows\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[90mTOPIC set, exported, and read inside single quotes by a child.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[93m▶ Type \u001b[92mcheck\u001b[93m when done.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n", "len": 537}
{"ts": 0.257446, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[1;90mcheck\u001b[0m \u001b[90m(test your work)\u001b[0m   \u001b[1;90mshow\u001b[0m \u001b[90m(the task again)\u001b[0m   \u001b[1;90mquit\u001b[0m \u001b[90m(save and leave)\u001b[0m\r\n", "len": 132}
{"ts": 0.257724, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n", "len": 253}
{"ts": 0.271565, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[?2004hshelltutor> ", "len": 20}
{"ts": 0.271681, "dir": "in", "enc": "utf8", "data": "TOPIC=shell\n", "len": 12}
{"ts": 0.271705, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "TOPIC=shell\r\n", "len": 13}
{"ts": 0.27172, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[?2004l\r", "len": 9}
{"ts": 0.271828, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[?2004h", "len": 8}
{"ts": 0.27184, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "shelltutor> ", "len": 12}
{"ts": 0.271863, "dir": "in", "enc": "utf8", "data": "export TOPIC\n", "len": 13}
{"ts": 0.271886, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "export TOPIC\r\n", "len": 14}
{"ts": 0.271897, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[?2004l\r", "len": 9}
{"ts": 0.271965, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[?2004h", "len": 8}
{"ts": 0.271976, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "shelltutor> ", "len": 12}
{"ts": 0.271999, "dir": "in", "enc": "utf8", "data": "bash -c 'echo $TOPIC' > seen.txt\n", "len": 33}
{"ts": 0.272048, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "bash -c 'echo $TOPIC' > seen.txt\r\n", "len": 34}
{"ts": 0.27206, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[?2004l\r", "len": 9}
{"ts": 0.277815, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[?2004hshelltutor> ", "len": 20}
{"ts": 0.277876, "dir": "in", "enc": "utf8", "data": "check\n", "len": 6}
{"ts": 0.277905, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "check\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r", "len": 16}
{"ts": 0.302645, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[3J\u001b[H\u001b[2J", "len": 11}
{"ts": 0.303933, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[90m──\u001b[0m \u001b[93mshelltutor\u001b[0m \u001b[90m──\u001b[0m \u001b[90mModule · env\u001b[0m \u001b[90m───────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m \u001b[90m──\u001b[0m\r\n", "len": 243}
{"ts": 0.303969, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\r\n", "len": 2}
{"ts": 0.304063, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[1;97menv cleared.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\nCommands and keys from this module:\r\n  \u001b[92mname=value    \u001b[0m \u001b[90mset a variable in this shell\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[92mexport name   \u001b[0m \u001b[90mlet child programs see it\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[92mecho \"$PATH\"  \u001b[0m \u001b[90mthe folders searched for programs\u001b[0m\r\n", "len": 261}
{"ts": 0.30411, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "  \u001b[92menv           \u001b[0m \u001b[90mlist what children receive\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[92mPS1='$ '      \u001b[0m \u001b[90mchange the prompt (this shell only)\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[93m▶ Type \u001b[92mquit\u001b[93m to leave, or \u001b[92mnext\u001b[93m to return to the start of this module.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n", "len": 240}
{"ts": 0.306718, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[1;90mnext\u001b[0m \u001b[90m(start this module again)\u001b[0m   \u001b[1;90mquit\u001b[0m \u001b[90m(leave)\u001b[0m   \u001b[1;90mshow\u001b[0m \u001b[90m(this screen again)\u001b[0m\r\n", "len": 134}
{"ts": 0.306984, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n", "len": 253}
